{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wall_stone","model_identifier":"wall_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# wall_stone\n\nStone wall: a straight segment one column (16 u) long along X, outer face toward -Z. End caps at both ends meet the next segment's cap to form a joint post. Stone: grey blocks, 3.6 m (128 u), one merlon, a walkway on top.\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 1 columns (16 x 16 units, 0.45 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y 0..128, z -10..10 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 6, construction_0 16, construction_33 26, construction_66 28, ruined 8 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 128 x 16 centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `wall_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `wall_stone_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_wall_stone` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_wall_walk` at (0, 119, 2)\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"wall","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,0.0,-8.0],"to":[8.0,118.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,47.0,118.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,47.0,118.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,47.0,118.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,47.0,118.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[36.0,138.0,52.0,154.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[36.0,138.0,52.0,154.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9b7a7220-01b2-590e-86c2-2267aa50d783"},{"name":"wall_merlon","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,118.0,-8.0],"to":[4.0,128.0,-4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28.0,156.0,36.0,166.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36.0,156.0,40.0,166.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28.0,156.0,36.0,166.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36.0,156.0,40.0,166.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,194.0,8.0,198.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,194.0,8.0,198.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"609b0517-a710-5055-b2a0-88913a82fe5f"},{"name":"wall_walk","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,118.0,-4.0],"to":[8.0,119.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[2.0,212.0,18.0,213.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18.0,212.0,30.0,213.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[2.0,212.0,18.0,213.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18.0,212.0,30.0,213.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,156.0,16.0,168.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,156.0,16.0,168.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"84ac79bb-98f4-55eb-bded-13e81e137112"},{"name":"wall_plinth","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"re